Rule 56 (If dtype of v_2 is complex, dtype of v_1 should not be boolean.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_2) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 10 then dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0
